  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feacal sludge management coordinator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSM is a gap in the movement response and gives occasions to HNS to rpofile themselves in this niche of WASH/Water management. NLRC supports and is connected to the global response within the cluster mechanism.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project funds the support to the Global WASH cluster by NLRC, who offers an advisor to lead the technical working group (TWIG) on Fecal Sludge Management</narrative>
  </description>
